esp←'Uno' 'Dos' 'Tres' '' ''
⌽saw eng esp
⍝ =>
(('enO') ('') ('') ('') ('eviF')) (('onU') ('soD') ('serT') ('') (''))

⍝ april/libraries/dfns/array/demo.lisp:325 —
saw ← {
  ⍺←⊢
  2≥|≡⍺ ⍵ ⍵:⍺ ⍺⍺ ⍵
  1≥|≡⍵    :⍺ ∇¨⊂⍵
