⍝ april/libraries/dfns/array/demo.lisp:368 —
subs ← {
  fs ts←≢¨fm to←⍺
  1≡≡⍺:to@(fm∘=)⍵
  0=⍴⍴⍵:⊃(⍵≡fm)⌽⍵(⊂to)
  lead←fs↑1
  (fm⍷⍵){
    ~1∊⍺:⍵
    ts↓↑,/{to,fs↓⍵}¨(lead,⍺)⊂fm,⍵
  }⍤1⊢⍵
}
↓⍕' -'∘subs 2 12⍴'Many a time and oft.    '
⍝ =>
('Many-a-time-') ('and-oft.----')

