⍝ april/libraries/dfns/graph/demo.lisp:101 — Initialize unreachable costs with empty-min identity and set the source cost to zero with @; avoids undefined infinity times zero under miniapl infinity policy
wpath ← {
  graph costs←↓⍺
  fm to←⍵
  tree←¯1⊣¨graph
  cost←0@fm⊢(⍴costs)⍴⌊/⍬
  I←⊃¨∘⊂
  fm{
    acc to←⍵
    to<0:(to=¯2)↓acc
    ⍺ ∇(to,acc)(to⊃⍺)
  }{
    tree cost←⍵
    ⍺≡⍬:tree ⍺⍺ ⍬ to
    adjv←⍺ I graph
    accm←⍺ I cost+costs
    best←adjv I¨⊂cost
    mask←accm<best⌊to⊃cost
    next←mask/¨adjv
    back←⊃,/⍺+0×next
    cvec←⊃,/mask/¨accm
    decr←{(⍒cvec)I ⍵}
    wave←decr↑,/next
    new←back cvec decr⍨@wave¨⍵
    (∪wave)∇ new
  }tree cost
}
md1←,¨↑((2 3) 4 4 ⍬) ((2 3) 1 2 ⍬)
md1 wpath 1 4
⍝ =>
1 2 4

