⍝ april/libraries/dfns/graph/demo.lisp:105 —
wmst ← {
  graph costs←↓⍺
  xvec←⍳⍴graph
  ⍵{
    tree todo←⍵
    todo≡⍬:tree
    edges←(graph∊¨⊂todo)∧xvec∊⍺
    min←⌊/⌊/¨edges/¨costs
    masks←edges∧min=costs
    fm to←{↑,/masks/¨⍵}¨xvec graph
    fm≡⍬:tree
    (⍺,to)∇(fm@to⊢tree)(todo~to)
  }(¯1⊣¨graph)(xvec~⍵)
}
aa←↑((2 3 4)(1 3)(1 2 4 5)(1 3 5)(3 4))((1 3 1)(1 2)(3 2 1 1)(1 1 1)(1 1))
