⍝ april/libraries/dfns/numeric/demo.lisp:61 — Origin-1 hex/dec/to setup; Detect x=x+1 by zero difference, avoiding configurable CT; original expected result
hex ← { 
  ⍺←⊢
  1≠≡,⍵:⍺ ∇¨⍵
  0∊⍵-1+⍵:'Too big'
  n←⍬⍴⍺,2*⌈2⍟2⌈16⍟1+⌈/|⍵
  ↓[1]'0123456789abcdef'[1+(n/16)⊤⍵]
}
dec ← { 
  ⍺←0
  1<⍴⍴⍵:⍺∘∇⍤1⊢⍵
  0≡≢⍵:0
  1≠≡,⍵:⍺ ∇¨⍵
  ws←∊∘(⎕UCS 9 10 13 32 133 160)
  ws⊃⍵:⍺ ∇ 1↓⍵
  ws⊃⌽⍵:⍺ ∇ ¯1↓⍵
  ∨/ws ⍵:⍺ ∇¨(1+ws ⍵)⊆⍵
  v←16|¯1+'0123456789abcdef0123456789ABCDEF'⍳⍵
  (16⊥v)-⍺×(8≤⊃v)×16*≢v
}
to ← { 
  from step←1 ¯1×-\2↑⍺,⍺+×⍵-⍺
  from+step×¯1+⍳0⌈1+⌊(⍵-from)÷step+step=0
}
hex 1234 5678
⍝ =>
('04d2') ('162e')

