  0∊⍵-1+⍵:'Too big'
  n←⍬⍴⍺,2*⌈2⍟2⌈16⍟1+⌈/|⍵
  ↓[1]'0123456789abcdef'[1+(n/16)⊤⍵]
}
dec ← { 
  ⍺←0
  1<⍴⍴⍵:⍺∘∇⍤1⊢⍵
  0≡≢⍵:0
  1≠≡,⍵:⍺ ∇¨⍵
