⍝ april/libraries/dfns/numeric/demo.lisp:224 — Compare both built-in inverse/solve and origin-1 Gauss-Jordan results independently; move upstream 1E-13 comparison allowance into fixture metadata instead of assigning ⎕CT [rtol=1e-13 atol=1e-13]
