    mat-(mat[;⍺]×⍺≠⍳≢⍵)∘.×mat[⍺;]
  }
  ⍺←=/↑⍳⍴⍵
  (⍴⍺)⍴(0 1×⍴⍵)↓↑elim/(⌽⍳⌊/⍴⍵),⊂⍵,⍺
}
