⍝ april/libraries/dfns/numeric/demo.lisp:303 —
polar ← {
  pol_car←{
    radius←{(+⌿⍵*2)*0.5}
    angle←{
      x y←⊂⍤¯1⊢⍵
      x0 xn←1 0=⊂0=x
      atan←¯3○y÷x+x0
      qne←(xn×atan)+x0×○0.5×2-×y
      nsw←○x<0
      qse←○2×(x>0)∧y<0
      nsw+qse+qne
    }
    (radius ⍵)lam angle ⍵
  }
  car_pol←{
    r o←⊂⍤¯1⊢⍵
    (r×2○o)lam r×1○o
  }
  lam←,[1-÷2]
  ⍺←1
  ⍺=+1:pol_car ⍵
  ⍺=-1:car_pol ⍵
}
⌊10000×polar⍉↑ ¯1 0 1∘.,1 0 ¯1
⍝ =>
2 3 3⍴14142 10000 14142 10000 0 10000 14142 10000 14142 23561 15707 7853 31415 31415 0 39269 47123 54977

