display ← { format←{t←↑,↓⍕⍵ ⋄ (¯2↑1 1,⍴t)⍴t} ⋄ 
  box←{
    vrt hrz←(¯1+⍴⍵)⍴¨'│─'
    top←'─⊖→'[1+¯1↑⍺],hrz
    bot←(⊃⍺),hrz
