    keys←↑key{⍺,(⊂⍺⍺),⍵}/ks
    okK←{⍵≡⍳⍴⍵}⍋↑keys
    okR←blk∨∧/bks
    okB←=/bs
    ok←okK∧okR∧okB∧∧/oks
    kr←⌽2⍴¯1⌽keys
    blks←blk+⌈/bs
    ht sz←1+(⌈/hs),+/ss
    dp←⍺++/ds
    ⍺>0:ok sz dp ht,kr blks blk
    ok sz(⌊0.5+dp÷sz)ht
  }
  search←{
    inf red(lft rgt)←⍺
    dir←1-2×>/⍋↑⊃¨inf ⍵
    _ nxt←dir wise lft rgt
    sub path←nxt ⍺⍺ ⍵
    subs←dir wise lft sub rgt
    (inf red subs)(dir,path)
  }
  rot←{
    Ninf Nred Nsubs←⍺
    (Linf Lred Lsubs)R←⍵ wise Nsubs
    ll lr←⍵ wise Lsubs
    N_←Ninf Nred(⍵ wise lr R)
